Week 10: Your Future Awaits
Project: Apply and Reflect

Step 1: Apply to a job or internship of your choosing 

You should submit a complete application even if you are only applying for practice and have no intention of taking the job. There's nothing like doing the "real thing" to prepare you for the moment when you would need to 
do it "for real". 

Step 2: Reflect on your application experience

Use the Application Reflection Template below to learn from your application experience, and reflect on your career rotation experience as a whole. Please take time to engage with these questions thoughtfully - think of it 
as job interview prep! 
